      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S COOL (3) registered his third win from five visits to Wyong when he chimed in late to take out a similar race to this 17 days ago. Only goes up 0.5kgs after the claim and can make further progress at the third run of the prep. Big chance to go back-to-back. CHARLINA (4) led for home but couldn't hold out HE'S COOL when resuming here at this trip last time out. Probably has greater scope for improvement than the top pick so a result reversal is not out of the question. BROWN SUGAR (5) is a handy mare back from a 12-week break. Went under by just a length at the first run last prep over 1100m at Canterbury. Unbeaten in two 1000m runs and can easily make it three from three today. BREMEL (1) has disappointed this prep but comes back in grade and might be the surprise packet.",
